[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21000.51, "timestamp": "05:50:00", "text": "是吗？你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21003.03, "timestamp": "05:50:03", "text": "表情符号。是的，我可以做一、二、三。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21004.35, "timestamp": "05:50:04", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21009.11, "timestamp": "05:50:09", "text": "这。从某种程度上来说，这确实行得通。但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21010.75, "timestamp": "05:50:10", "text": "问题是这些是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21014.07, "timestamp": "05:50:14", "text": "物体。什么？呃，而且不是数组。以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21016.628, "timestamp": "05:50:16", "text": "这意味着我必须这样做，所以问题是我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21020.27, "timestamp": "05:50:20", "text": "在我随机化每个的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21023.27, "timestamp": "05:50:23", "text": "一切都乱了套，而我正在独自一人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21026.15, "timestamp": "05:50:26", "text": "弄清楚这一点，我必须列出很多变量。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21039.39, "timestamp": "05:50:39", "text": "很多。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21042.51, "timestamp": "05:50:42", "text": "总之，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21045.708, "timestamp": "05:50:45", "text": "好的。反正，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21054.61, "timestamp": "05:50:54", "text": "出去。嗯"}]